From 3de16ed4e7b4dc99758193736d2b4ccc7b311602 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 19:12:14 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 48/49] Preserve hybrid verify-window state across trim

Checkpoint only partial recurrent state, trim hybrid attention directly, and replay the accepted prefix so pipelined speculative windows can recover without copying the full long-context attention cache.

Based on the recurrent checkpoint work from the Inkling branch.

Assisted-by: codex
